  "body": "Must be sold! This exceptional freehold property offers the ultimate configuration for extended families, multigenerational living, or savvy buyers seeking a boarder income. Combining a spacious main residence with a fully self-contained flat, this is versatile real estate at its absolute best.\r\n\r\nMain Residence: Space, Character & Sunshine\r\nThis exceptional home features four spacious bedrooms, highlighted by a master suite with a private walk in wardrobe. Two separate bathrooms are designed to eliminate morning rushes for busy families. The open plan living area is bathed in natural light, showcasing soaring pitched ceilings and character rich exposed timber beams. Enjoy seamless indoor outdoor flow as the modern kitchen and dining spaces open directly onto a sunny, private entertaining deck.\r\n\r\nSelf Contained Granny Flat: True Independence\r\nThe completely private granny flat layout includes its own dedicated external entrance to ensure total independence. This fully equipped living space features a dedicated kitchen, a full bathroom, and a completely independent laundry. It offers exceptional income potential and is perfectly suited for boarders, flatmates, or multi generational extended families.\r\n\r\nElite School Zoning \r\nMilford School\r\nTakapuna Normal Intermediate\r\nWestlake Boys' High School\r\nWestlake Girls' High School",
